  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating and Strengthening malaria Control in Mozambique - Mozambique (01-Jul-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique, Malaria, World Vision International (WVI)This program has the following goals: By 2016, halve the malaria morbidity and mortality rates observed in 2009. The objectives of this program are: By 2016, 100% of the population has access to at least one malaria prevention method.  By 2016, reach 100% of the population with information on malaria, with at least 60% following best practice malaria prevention and treatment behaviors.  By 2016, test 100% of suspected malaria cases presenting in health facilities and communities and treat according to national guidelines</narrative>
  </description>
